  "text/html": "<html xmlns:o=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\"\nxmlns:w=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word\"\nxmlns:m=\"http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/2004/12/omml\"\nxmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"></head><h1 style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 16pt; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; color: rgb(46, 116, 181); font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><a name=\"s_headings\"></a><a name=\"_Toc8\"><span>1. Headings and inline marks</span></a><o:p></o:p></h1><h2 style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 13pt; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; color: rgb(46, 116, 181); font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><a name=\"_Toc9\">Heading Two</a><span></span><span lang=\"RU\"><o:p></o:p></span></h2><h3 style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; color: rgb(31, 77, 120); font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><a name=\"_Toc10\">Heading Three</a><o:p></o:p></h3><h4 style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; color: rgb(46, 116, 181); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">Heading Four<o:p></o:p></h4><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">The<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><b>quick</b><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><i>brown</i><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><u>fox</u><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>jumps over the<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><s>lazy</s><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><a href=\"https://example.com/\" style=\"color: rgb(149, 79, 114); text-decoration: underline;\">dog</a>. Water is H<sub>2</sub>O and E = mc<sup>2</sup>.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; text-align: center;\">This paragraph is centered.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"right\" style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; text-align: right;\">This paragraph is aligned right.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; text-align: justify;\">This paragraph is justified, and it is long enough to wrap onto a second line so that the justification is visible in the document.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">This line ends with a soft break,<br>and this line continues the same paragraph.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 0);\">Red text</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>and<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(47, 85, 151);\">blue text</span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>keep their color in Word, but the kit must not map text color to its palette.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoQuote\" style=\"margin: 0in 0.5in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-style: italic; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">A quotation in the built-in Quote style.<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><o:p> </o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman, serif; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">The empty paragraph above is intentional.<o:p></o:p></p></html>",
  "text/plain": "1. Headings and inline marks\r\nHeading Two\r\nHeading Three\r\nHeading Four\r\nThe quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog. Water is H2O and E = mc2.\r\nThis paragraph is centered.\r\nThis paragraph is aligned right.\r\nThis paragraph is justified, and it is long enough to wrap onto a second line so that the justification is visible in the document.\r\nThis line ends with a soft break,\r\nand this line continues the same paragraph.\r\nRed text and blue text keep their color in Word, but the kit must not map text color to its palette.\r\nA quotation in the built-in Quote style.\r\n\r\nThe empty paragraph above is intentional.\r\n"
